Error [E2404]: This implicit fallible call can't turn a `Err` into a `[FieldError]` here
  --> tests/ui/validate_impure_rule.jet:9:22
    |
  9 |     validate { check(leaky(), at: email, "required") }
    |                      ^^^^^
 Why: Ordinary fallible calls propagate automatically; there's no declared way to turn `Err` into `[FieldError]`
 Fix: Add `impl Err -> [FieldError] { … }` before this function
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2404

Error [E3401]: `validate` calls the impure function `leaky`
  --> tests/ui/validate_impure_rule.jet:9:22
    |
  9 |     validate { check(leaky(), at: email, "required") }
    |                      ^^^^^
 Why: `leaky` is impure, but `validate` declares `-[]>`
 Fix: Give `leaky` an explicit `-[]>` bound, or remove the call from `validate`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3401
